{"publicId":"a23c0616-2329-44ce-817c-1897049296bf","title":"Jolt发布：无JVM Clojure实现原生支持C交互","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T16:23:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T16:23:01.000Z","digest":"GitHub项目Jolt发布，提供无需JVM的Clojure实现，支持原生C交互及静态链接二进制文件。\n\nJolt基于便携式Scheme层，兼容Chez（R7RS Scheme）和Gambit（JS后端），允许开发者通过defcfn绑定任意C共享库，如调用C函数时使用Clojure值传递。其编译工具jolt build可将项目（含运行时、标准库、应用代码及依赖）编译为独立二进制，静态链接C库，无需JVM或Chez环境，且无需保留源码即可运行。\n\n与早期版本不同，最新发布明确支持Chez原生运行和Gambit JavaScript后端，同时移除JVM依赖。目前仅提供GitHub仓库代码，尚未有正式发布版本。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T18:21:52.529Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Jolt 开源 Clojure 实现支持原生 C 交互","latestReport":{"id":"vtpfn1ii5hohbw9tz11dakkjh"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f5vXyeh-aiFA","title":"Jolt – Clojure that speaks C","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T16:23:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"vtpfn1ii5hohbw9tz11dakkjh","title":"Jolt 开源 Clojure 实现支持原生 C 交互","summary":"Jolt 是 Clojure 的自托管实现，支持原生 C 交互，编译为无需 JVM 的独立二进制文件。通过 Gambit 编译器将 Clojure 代码转换为 Scheme，可运行在 Chez 或 Gambit 编译的 JavaScript 后端，提供 persistent data structures、core.async 并发模型等完整 Clojure语义。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T16:23:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"vtpfn1ii5hohbw9tz11dakkjh","title":"Jolt 开源 Clojure 实现支持原生 C 交互","summary":"Jolt 是 Clojure 的自托管实现，支持原生 C 交互，编译为无需 JVM 的独立二进制文件。通过 Gambit 编译器将 Clojure 代码转换为 Scheme，可运行在 Chez 或 Gambit 编译的 JavaScript 后端，提供 persistent data structures、core.async 并发模型等完整 Clojure语义。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T16:23:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T22:00:0